        "created_at": "2018-02-01T02:00:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<blockquote><p>As a completely unbiased voice on the internet what is your opinion of Fate of the Elder Gods?</p></blockquote><p>I like it a bunch! It's a good game. I love all the ways the mechanics work together to support and advance the theme, and the individual powers for each god/cult/lodge are awesome. However! It is not so much for me, as a primary part of the game play is \"take that\" stuff that you do to other cults by sending investigators at them or cursing them, and I am not one for \"take that\" games. I mean, look, I'm kind of into cooperative games, right?&nbsp;</p><p>But yeah, definitely a good game, even if not for me.</p>",
